Z||000000||Rodney||11-19-2001||07:39 AM||||I have made up a few prototype adjustable clutch banjos. They are 2 piece so there is only one nut to tighten. You do have to take out the clutch master cylinder to install them. You will need to cut your old banjo in half to steal the special washer and rubber boot. I have a few to offer for $20 each. If they are a useful and needed part I'll make more and add them to my web page. ||||reg||1
